  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'EXPOSING OUR TEXT MESSAGES...', 'This week on HAHA PODCAST , the Ha Sisters are getting into everything texting ! From friendships and relationships to family group chats, we break down what kind of texters we really are. what that says about us. Are we fast responders, dry texters, overthinkers, or voice-note abusers?We also play a game where we search up a word in our message histories and react to whatever juicy, embarrassing, or unexpected texts come up👀. Let’s just say… some things should’ve stayed in the drafts.Join Emily (17), Erica (21), and Evelyn (26) as we talk texting habits, red flags, miscommunications, and the', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/2fa36b2b-a9fc-46b0-b2cb-c3a3964399dd/episodes/4f4be16f-2f6d-4a33-af7f-d638a19db8f5/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=2fa36b2b-a9fc-46b0-b2cb-c3a3964399dd&amp;awEpisodeId=4f4be16f-2f6d-4a33-af7f-d638a19db8f5&amp;feed=C8KWN7oI', 3766, '2026-01-20 14:00:00'::timestamptz, 41000);
