  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'TIKTOK FAMOUS AT 17 YEARS OLD… | KATIE FANG', 'Welcome back to HAHA PODCAST 🎙️ In this episode, we sit down with the one and only Katie Fang, the TikTok sensation who blew up overnight. Can you believe she is only 19?! We dive into her journey to sudden success, what life looks like for her now, how she navigates adulthood, and her big move to NYC. It’s real, funny, and the perfect convo for anyone chasing their dreams or figuring life out in their teen life. Tune in, laugh with us, and don’t forget to subscribe! 💛✨ Available on ⁠⁠⁠⁠Youtube⁠⁠⁠⁠ ⁠⁠⁠⁠Spotify⁠⁠⁠⁠ ⁠⁠⁠⁠Apple⁠⁠⁠⁠ ⁠⁠Amazon⁠⁠⁠ Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See pcm.ad', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/2fa36b2b-a9fc-46b0-b2cb-c3a3964399dd/episodes/605ff14b-4d9d-43b1-8d74-9bdb8483baf5/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=2fa36b2b-a9fc-46b0-b2cb-c3a3964399dd&amp;awEpisodeId=605ff14b-4d9d-43b1-8d74-9bdb8483baf5&amp;feed=C8KWN7oI', 2998, '2025-12-02 14:00:00'::timestamptz, 48000);
