  VALUES (v_pod_id, '#1 Women’s Hormone Doctor: Take Control of Your Body, Balance Hormones, &amp; Feel Amazing', 'Today’s episode is your ultimate women’s hormone health guide for every age. If you are dealing with painful periods, infertility, endometriosis, PCOS, struggling with perimenopause, menopause, or confused about birth control - this episode is a MUST listen. From PMS to menopause, this episode will teach you how to use science to hack your hormones, reset your body, and feel amazing again. Today, Mel sits down with Dr. Sharon Malone, MD, one of the most trusted medical experts in women’s health today, to cover health topics we have never discussed on this podcast before. Whether you’re 25, 35,', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/f03d28ac-567c-49eb-a36d-cc19dd0be0e9/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=f03d28ac-567c-49eb-a36d-cc19dd0be0e9&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 4755, '2026-07-23 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 47000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'The Manipulation Expert: 4 Hidden Signs You’re Dealing With a Toxic Person', 'In today’s episode, you’ll learn the hidden signs of a manipulative, toxic person from the #1 researcher in the world on dark personalities, Dr. Leanne ten Brinke, PhD. She is here to teach you how to spot the poisonous people that are hidden in plain sight around you – in your family, your community, and at work. And, she’s giving you the science-backed guide to understand poisonous people: how they operate, how to spot the patterns early, and what to do when you realize you’re dealing with one. Dr. ten Brinke is a professor at the University of British Columbia, where she directs the Truth a', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/dcf53e4c-389d-4c9b-81e9-b8fa46dbf12e/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=dcf53e4c-389d-4c9b-81e9-b8fa46dbf12e&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 3836, '2026-07-20 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 48000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'How to Master Your Emotions &amp; Never Get Angry or Bothered by Anyone', 'Are you going to keep being controlled by your emotions for the rest of your life? The answer is no. Because today, Dr. Marc Brackett, PhD, the world’s leading expert on emotional intelligence is here to tell you, “Success in virtually every aspect of life – career, friendship, love, and family – is determined mainly by one thing: how we deal with emotions.” Because your emotions are running your life – and you don’t even realize it. Dr. Brackett is the Founder & Director of the Yale Center for Emotional Intelligence whose research proves that your life is being shaped by the one skill that 90', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/8a2f345e-e37e-4bda-ac85-38abbfd1a6f3/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=8a2f345e-e37e-4bda-ac85-38abbfd1a6f3&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 4100, '2026-07-16 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 49000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Feeling Lost or Behind in Life? The #1 Happiness Expert Explains How to Find Your Purpose', 'In today’s episode, you’ll learn how to feel happier and more connected to your purpose in under 5 minutes. Today, you’re learning from Dr. Dacher Keltner, one of the world’s leading experts on meaning, purpose, happiness, and awe. Dr. Keltner is a distinguished professor of psychology at UC Berkeley, and the founding director of the Greater Good Science Center, one of the most renowned research institutes in the world that studies well-being. He has spent over 35 years researching science-backed tools that you can use right now. You will be clear, focused, calmer, more engaged in your life, e', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/7e5f07d7-0d24-4923-b175-f8bf3be59559/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=7e5f07d7-0d24-4923-b175-f8bf3be59559&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 3989, '2026-07-13 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 50000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'How to Get More Out of Life: Make More Money &amp; Build Something That Matters with Seth Godin', 'Two simple questions can change the way you make decisions, spend your time, and build your future. In today’s episode, Mel sits down with Seth Godin, one of the most influential thinkers of our time and one of Mel’s most trusted mentors. Seth has written more than 20 bestselling books, taught millions of people how to think differently, and shaped the way Mel thinks about success, confidence, purpose, business, and making an impact. Today, Seth is sharing the advice Mel wishes everyone could hear, particularly when it comes to business and success. His wisdom will make you rethink how you spe', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/fbed2f05-c1d0-4360-8a94-eda3d22f7048/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=fbed2f05-c1d0-4360-8a94-eda3d22f7048&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 3881, '2026-07-11 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 51000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '8 Simple Reminders You Need to Hear Right Now', 'Today, you’re getting exactly what you need to take back your power and make life feel a little easier. In this solo episode, Mel shares 8 simple reminders that will help you feel stronger, calmer, and more confident. These are the words to come back to when you need courage, perspective, and a reminder of how much strength you already have. Through 8 powerful quotes and straight-to-the-point coaching, Mel will show you how to stop taking other people’s behavior personally, pause before you react, protect your peace, take responsibility for your own happiness, and make something good happen to', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/3b725c1f-65b3-48fa-9a04-229418d24ca8/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=3b725c1f-65b3-48fa-9a04-229418d24ca8&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 3650, '2026-07-09 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 52000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'How to Master Any Conversation, Communicate With Confidence, and Deal With Difficult People', 'What if you could walk into any room and become the person everyone remembers? Someone who can communicate with confidence, command respect, and create lasting connections? Today, Mel sits down with Oz Pearlman, a world-renowned mentalist who has spent decades mastering the skills that make people more trustworthy, respected, and likeable. On stage, Oz creates the illusion of reading minds. But in this energizing conversation, he reveals the tools behind his success that you can use in your own life to read people, talk to anyone, and communicate with confidence. You’ll learn how to pay attent', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/3d4f3fc3-a7cc-484f-b175-b106e1a9553e/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=3d4f3fc3-a7cc-484f-b175-b106e1a9553e&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 4124, '2026-07-06 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 53000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Create a Happier Version of Yourself: Redirect Your Energy for Positive Thinking', 'In this episode, you will learn how to take back your power when you’re in the midst of change, stress, or uncertainty, and then redirect your energy for self-transformation. If there’s an area of your life that you’re feeling unhappy about and want to take control over, today’s episode will show you exactly what to do. Joining Mel in this deeply personal episode is her 21-year-old son Oakley. He candidly shares how he went from feeling stuck and lonely, to finally feeling happy again, and the simple mindset shifts and changes that made the biggest difference. He and Mel openly unpack how to g', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pdrl.fm/123755/stitcher.simplecastaudio.com/b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998/episodes/0b67ab57-f425-4eef-b093-5a10aa4adf7d/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=b9de9f5f-6dab-4833-b4c2-05f1d28dd998&amp;awEpisodeId=0b67ab57-f425-4eef-b093-5a10aa4adf7d&amp;feed=UCwaTX1J', 3881, '2026-07-02 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 54000);
END $$;

-- ---------- Sidebar: A Suits Watch Podcast ----------
DO $$
DECLARE
  v_host_id uuid;
  v_pod_id uuid;
  v_cat uuid;
BEGIN
  SELECT id INTO v_cat FROM categories WHERE name_ar = 'ثقافة وأدب' LIMIT 1;
  INSERT INTO hosts (name_ar, slug, photo_url, cover_url, title_ar, specialty_ar, bio_ar, country, category_id, is_verified, followers_count)
  VALUES ('SiriusXM Podcasts', 'sidebar-a-suits-watch-podcast', 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/26/5b/70/265b706a-673d-b22d-918a-203b2e2286ab/mza_3444257736061308049.jpg/600x600bb.jpg', 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/26/5b/70/265b706a-673d-b22d-918a-203b2e2286ab/mza_3444257736061308049.jpg/600x600bb.jpg', 'مقدم', 'ثقافة وأدب', 'بودكاست حقيقي: Sidebar: A Suits Watch Podcast', 'أونلاين', v_cat, true, 50000)
  RETURNING id INTO v_host_id;

  INSERT INTO podcasts (title, description, host_id, category_id, type, cover_url, audience_level, plays_count, rating_avg)
  VALUES ('Sidebar: A Suits Watch Podcast', 'Join Patrick J. Adams and Sarah Rafferty as they recap episodes from the hit TV show “Suits” where they played Mike Ross and Donna Paulson respectively on the show. Sarah and Patrick share their personal experience being on the show, interview fellow cast members, answer listener questions, and share behind-the-scenes stories. Never seen Suits before? No problem - neither have Patrick and Sarah. Join them on their first watch to learn why Suits has become a phenomenon.', v_host_id, v_cat, 'cultural', 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts211/v4/26/5b/70/265b706a-673d-b22d-918a-203b2e2286ab/mza_3444257736061308049.jpg/600x600bb.jpg', 'beginner', 100000, 4.7)
  RETURNING id INTO v_pod_id;

  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'The Can-Opener Special', 'They asked, and you answered! This week, Sarah and Patrick are discussing YOUR theories behind the infamous can-opener scene in the Season 1 finale. They involve canned fruit, pure magic, cans of whoop-ass, and thumbtack juries? There are no bad theories (at least for Sarah), and we hear them all! And that is case closed on Season one of Sidebar! Thank you all for joining us, and for all of your input and support, we loved revisiting Season 1 of Suits with you. As we head into hiatus we would love to hear from you. Please do us a favor and send us your feedback at suitsrewatch@gmail.com. Tell ', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/d2527cf7-761f-491c-9c69-7492e56b5585/audio/07b457d4-6e14-4eed-b2af-7044294601ec/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 2566, '2025-02-25 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 5000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Clearing the Docket with Aaron Korsh &amp; Kevin Bray - Pt. 2', 'We are back with part 2 of our conversation about season 1 of "Suits" with creator Aaron Korsh, and producing director Kevin Bray. This week, we discuss how Kevin empowered Sarah and Donna, the challenges of making "Suits," Kevin and Aaron''s can-opener theories, the story of casting Rachel Zane, and why Sarah almost wasn''t cast as Donna.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/963bd262-a37f-4055-b73c-c7db05679d55/audio/19d7739f-1c16-4faf-b9cc-38cc11e530cd/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 4025, '2025-02-18 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 6000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Clearing The Docket with Aaron Korsh &amp; Kevin Bray - Pt. 1', 'Mom and Dad are in studio! That''s right - this week we have creator Aaron Korsh and producing director Kevin Bray in studio to discuss ALL of season 1 of "Suits!" We cover what the early days of "Suits" felt like, hear Kevin''s theory that Harvey wears Ugg boots at home, discuss which magical moments Aaron believes really made "Suits," point out Kevin''s special connection with Patrick, and more. Come back next week to hear Aaron and Kevin share their theories on the can-opener, Rachel Zane chemistry reads, and Aaron''s initial reaction to the "Suits: LA" pilot.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/507b62e6-6faf-4263-8fc1-c81271aa7118/audio/f43d99d3-88e4-428a-9de6-fda59a99805a/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 4686, '2025-02-11 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 7000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Dog Fight', 'It’s the moment you’ve all been waiting for... we finally take a deep dive into the can opener! We’ve reached the season 1 finale, "Dog Fight." Kevin Bray was back at the helm and Patrick and Sarah are ready to discuss. They play "who said it?" with the best one-liners, and Kiki’s day is made when Sarah casually drops intel about The Devil Wears Prada. Sarah breaks down one of the greatest scenes of the season for Patrick, and they reminisce about learning the show had earned a second season!', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/1bba4d45-de0a-4d7e-bf94-a80dbbd967a8/audio/64826b3b-8ad8-4282-97f8-b68d664c3e68/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 4930, '2025-02-04 19:20:16'::timestamptz, 8000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Rules of the Game', 'This week Sarah and Patrick dig into the penultimate episode of season 1 – Rules of the Game – which, lucky for us, includes multiple scenes with everyone’s favorite chaotic duo! Director Mike Smith shares his memories of working with Patrick and Sarah, we debate the correct way to pronounce "mentor," and our hosts share advice they received from veteran actors early in their careers. And on that note, how do we feel about Mike and Donna’s acting skills? It’s all leading up to the first season finale of Suits!', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/0fffd0ee-ed21-45d5-b08f-bade44e88aa5/audio/c13afa48-3b69-4f95-b4a7-09bc20b70ad0/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 4082, '2025-01-28 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 9000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Hanging Out with Vanessa Ray &amp; Tom Lipinski', 'After 15 years, they''ve still got it! This week, we have Vanessa Ray (Jenny) and Tom Lipinski (Trevor) in studio to talk about their Suits journeys. We hear audition stories, learn which celeb''s loft "Suits" rented for first Mike/Trevor/Jenny scene, get behind-the-scenes stories on iconic moments like the handshake and the fight scene. Plus, listen to Sarah and Vanessa become besties in real-time.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/3fd9c459-0235-46ac-9783-72f63eb4b7ca/audio/2cb1719f-a070-4198-a2fa-fda4780a7e11/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3954, '2025-01-21 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 10000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'The Shelf Life', 'Theories abound as Sarah and Patrick dive into S1 E10 - The Shelf Life. What kind of favor did Harvey do for a judge? What did Louis say to get clocked by his date? Why didn’t we ever use that building entrance again? They have no idea but the guesses will shock you. They also break down the famous "Life''s like this, I like this" Harvey scene and of course discover even more "Rick Should Have Won An Emmy" moments. But first, Patrick gives us an update on his face bump, and Sarah talks about the Herbal Essences commercial that changed her life.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/65b907b5-ee6a-4956-924b-7ec3acda3dd7/audio/019a41b1-944e-495a-8881-412fb37f0a62/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 4284, '2025-01-14 15:09:35'::timestamptz, 11000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Undefeated', 'Update - we at Sidebar have the giggles. Happy New Year! This week, Sarah and Patrick are covering S1 E9 - Undefeated. But first, what is going on with the bump on Patrick''s face? They discuss checking your friend''s bumps, how great Eric Close is as Harvey''s rival "Tanner," how important tailors were while making "Suits," dealing with conflict on set, why we love Pooch Hall, and one of the best Rachel/Louis moments in all of Suits.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/9b30d7b4-c2fd-4129-a8da-04ca5cb97980/audio/8e30992f-8f2c-46ca-8252-80cc0c9c54d7/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3789, '2025-01-07 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 12000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'In Chambers: 2024 Is Adjourned', 'Happy New Year''s Eve to all of our listeners! To end the year, right, Sarah and Patrick check in with each other, and with all of you. They discuss memorable New Years memories, talk about what they want in 2025, and answer more of your questions. Thank you again to everyone for listening. We are so grateful to you all!', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/fc5e353c-903c-4d2f-81fd-1a4fed8742b1/audio/cbae4dd5-7a8e-4fdd-9ea6-2a9e8621d98f/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 2394, '2024-12-31 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 13000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Suits at ATX', 'Happy Holidays from everyone at Sidebar! This week, we have a gift for our listeners - the audio from the Suits Retrospective at ATX! First, Sarah and Patrick check in and discuss favorite holiday traditions (candy in clogs, anyone?). Then, we go back to June 2024 to hear Patrick and Sarah as well as Dulé Hill, Abigail Spencer, Amanda Schull, and Jeff Wachtel share memories from filming, theories about their characters, and answer audience questions. Thank you again to Netflix Tudum and ATX for this wonderful event.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/e539eca0-2de3-4c2b-a7e5-e4a66a68633e/audio/4fa4d6e9-561d-4aed-bcf4-b76a309fd984/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3762, '2024-12-24 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 14000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Identity Crisis', 'This week, Sidebar gets spicy! Sarah and Patrick bring their quibbles (or are they quabbles?) to discuss S1 E8 - Identity Crisis. Sarah shares about the history around June 3rd 1997, a guest star is awarded the Gina Tor-Riz Award, and Patrick bemoans how cool Harvey looks in a hardhat. Plus, we have a bonus word count this week - listen to the end to find out!', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/5c10b2dc-074b-4c14-b4c9-90af5a4e9ff3/audio/cb0a4d8c-708f-4761-92de-cf9c16af2f57/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3768, '2024-12-17 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 15000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'In Chambers with Patrick &amp; Sarah', 'This week, the listeners are on the docket! That''s right - we are in chambers with Patrick and Sarah, and they are answering your questions. They share where you can get Sidebar merch ( siriusxmstore.com/sidebar ), hint at when we may be getting info on the can-opener, discuss character theme songs, hear from Patrick''s Brazilian dub artist Airam, talk about Harvey''s basketballs, get to the bottom on how Mike wears his watch, and more. Check out Airam''s work dubbing Patrick here - https://www.instagram.com/p/C6WnOmwrQnX/?hl=en', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/08c1459f-59e0-41f1-ac2c-d09de4072801/audio/03319819-59a3-4e78-9af3-c1964c6233b2/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3214, '2024-12-10 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 16000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Play the Man', 'This week''s episode is brought to you by yacht rock! Patrick and Sarah groove their way through S1 E7 - Play the Man. We learn that Patrick is a Trekkie, Sarah loves Bread (the band...and maybe the food?), and that they both love Scottie. #TeamRachel and #TeamJenny resurface, and Abigail Spencer shares with us how she ended up on Suits.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/4e2a8ecd-cff1-4197-bd81-394adffb4bd3/audio/5c4c226b-eb1e-4a77-b24a-fa8375d6fff7/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 4047, '2024-12-03 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 17000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Casting Suits with Bonnie Zane', 'This week, Patrick and Sarah talk with Suits Casting Director Bonnie Zane... and she brought a treat - their original auditions! Sarah and Patrick watch their auditions for the first time in-studio, and share their reactions in real-time. They discuss Bonnie''s legendary career, what casting Suits was like, the stories behind finding Louis Litt, Rachel Zane, and of course Mike and Donna. Plus, she shares some details from working on the upcoming Suits: LA.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/13f4665f-89c7-4166-9833-28bd98a0884f/audio/2cf01bd2-29a3-45cd-9d7c-1fb559009105/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3293, '2024-11-26 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 18000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Tricks of the Trade', 'Welcome to our newest podcast - The Hobbyist Arborist! Just kidding... this week Patrick and Sarah talk about Suits S1 Episode 6, titled Tricks of the Trade. They create a "nest of trust" to discuss how they feel about this week''s fashion, we hear from Max Topplin on how he got cast as the beloved Harold, we learn which moment from "Old School" Patrick was inspired by in his performance, we rename #sexybits to The Gina Tor-RIZ award, and get a play-by-play of watching Suits with Sarah and Patrick while they are on a plane together.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/674dadcd-c932-4a07-956d-c69aecacacfc/audio/bd35a5a1-4828-4d12-846e-11b96b7c7892/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3597, '2024-11-19 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 19000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Bail Out', 'This week Sarah and Patrick are talking season 1, episode 5, Bail Out! Patrick recounts his meeting with a bear, and we introduce a new segment - the Motherload - where Patrick’s mom sends her hot takes on the episode. We answer the age old question - can you really crochet pantyhose, and dive deep into the scene that changed Donna’s trajectory for the rest of the series. Finally, we attempt to solve one of the great Suits mysteries: where on earth is the Mike Ross doll? If you know, reach out to us at the below email!', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/5ed61052-962b-4c36-aaba-722ff7b23f39/audio/6c095213-ca94-4c86-add0-abf2e2928b12/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3912, '2024-11-12 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 20000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Gina Torres', 'The myth... the legend... the BOSS - Jessica Pearson is in the studio. This week, Patrick and Sarah speak with Gina Torres on how she got the role, playing the most powerful person in the room, the moments Gina stood up for Sarah on set, and of course - the clothes. They go all in on the beautiful costumes Gina wore as Jessica, because "there''s no reason she wouldn''t wear what she wanted to."', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/7a506be8-e6e6-4747-9b4f-221d03facbf8/audio/c0b88ec4-f047-488d-ad01-8218b7bdf3d9/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3701, '2024-11-05 05:05:00'::timestamptz, 21000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Dirty Little Secrets', 'This week Patrick and Sarah break down Dirty Little Secrets, and they want to know "are you in bed with them?" In bed watching on your laptops of course! Sarah schools us on the best college pizza, Patrick clears the air about his height and the two discuss why Jessica doesn''t have her own assistant, what to do if you get bedbugs, and the helmet is BACK! Plus, Patrick does his best Braveheart impression.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/be5a2472-6e80-4e31-a381-67d442a82611/audio/ca09e7d7-6237-4452-a8c4-9b4c0c945c2b/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3259, '2024-10-29 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 22000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Inside Track', 'Suits is in Toronto! This week, Patrick and Sarah dive into episode 3 - Inside Track. We find out what it was like moving to, or in Patrick’s case moving *back* to Toronto and reveal which cast mate lived with both Patrick and Sarah during season 1. We explore Donna’s favorite word, and discuss love triangles, what it’s like to watch your own kissing scenes, and get a little background on the g*ddamn counter.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/094bd9e1-3e6e-4c68-81d5-e52cdcf5f41a/audio/6a3330fe-c8de-4bf6-93dd-6dd70cec9e60/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3994, '2024-10-22 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 23000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Errors &amp; Omissions', 'On this week''s episode, Sarah and Patrick break down episode 2 of Suits - Errors and Omissions. And things get a little bit... sexy... They discuss what Sarah is calling the "Tennis Dream Ballet," the process of moving to Toronto and what the city means to them, the line neither of them knew from Fast Times at Ridgemont High, whether or not Harvey should date Lauren, and more.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/1684fd34-993c-4b0e-8665-c10de2b4cfd1/audio/a2182f9f-39ff-44a9-a0cf-28b4fcfd3672/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 4540, '2024-10-15 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 24000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Tailoring &quot;Suits&quot; with Creator Aaron Korsh', 'This week we go back to where it all began. Patrick and Sarah share their Suits origin stories including who gave Sarah the script and what the audition process was like for Patrick. Then, Aaron Korsh, the creator of Suits, joins the chat to share what inspired him to create the show, the personal tragedy that pushed him to pursue his dream of writing, where Harvey and Donna’s names originated, which actor is least like their on-screen persona, and so much more.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/4556ea0d-aeff-4bbf-a404-18c441d63583/audio/b992f6f1-a2f9-4fda-b112-e63d54c9110d/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3893, '2024-10-08 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 25000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Pilot Pt. 2', 'This week, Patrick J. Adams and Sarah Rafferty walk us through the second part of the Suits pilot. They share memories of attending the Golden Globes (and who Sarah has a sanctioned crush on), discuss which iconic actor Patrick is channeling in the pilot, point out what Suits "codes" already appear in this first episode, debate if Mike can look cool in a bike helmet, and more.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/83b46a69-ac35-4e58-a7e8-1a41dfb39833/audio/ff63b8f4-c68f-4cee-b63f-be9bbc0361b1/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3211, '2024-10-01 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 26000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Pilot Pt. 1', 'This week, Patrick and Sarah are discussing the first thirty minutes of the Suits pilot episode. They dive into why they are making this podcast, their first impressions of each other, the things that distract Patrick when he''s watching, Sarah''s first-day jitters, why Donna is responsible for everything that happens on Suits, and more. Feel free to email us a voice memo of your questions about Suits at sidebarpodcast@siriusxm.com. We may use it on the show! Follow us on Instagram & TikTok - @suitssidebar', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/dc0f4ed9-49f5-412f-b92a-2e32396e2a8a/audio/4842d8ce-96d0-4c43-bc39-3fdbaf20a4f2/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 3774, '2024-09-24 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 27000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Donna The Meme 😉', 'Sarah and Patrick just can''t wait until the podcast is out on September 24th. So, here''s a little sneak peek to tide us over until then! Sidebar: A Suits Watch Podcast is out next Tuesday, September 24th wherever you get your podcasts.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/349b2b09-f2c6-496a-abb2-1a911196ac05/audio/54c40652-ae39-4424-a1b1-83932fc3e3cc/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 173, '2024-09-17 04:05:00'::timestamptz, 28000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, 'Can We Sidebar? | Coming September 24th', 'Patrick J. Adams and Sarah Rafferty starred on the tv series Suits. But, they have never really watched the show... until now! Join them each week as they watch episodes, tell behind-the-scenes stories, and talk with creators and co-stars. Sidebar launches Tuesday, September 24th.', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/cdn.simplecast.com/audio/14ee505c-0839-4073-a311-3e7c64b51b8e/episodes/8a94797c-c916-4652-bbda-decedcd4b5c0/audio/64c30a24-8f98-4a33-b901-4d4939f8fc93/default_tc.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;feed=Ch9N4eTz', 139, '2024-09-09 22:00:04'::timestamptz, 29000);
END $$;

-- ---------- Real English Conversations Podcast | English Fluency For Newcomers And International Professionals ----------
DO $$
DECLARE
  v_host_id uuid;
  v_pod_id uuid;
  v_cat uuid;
BEGIN
  SELECT id INTO v_cat FROM categories WHERE name_ar = 'المسيرة المهنية' LIMIT 1;
  INSERT INTO hosts (name_ar, slug, photo_url, cover_url, title_ar, specialty_ar, bio_ar, country, category_id, is_verified, followers_count)
  VALUES ('Real English Conversations: With Curtis Davies - English Podcast', 'real-english-conversations-podcast-english-fluency-for-newcomers-and-international-professionals', 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts112/v4/61/7b/bd/617bbd1b-f044-32de-ea79-49ef786c4775/mza_16513957672551773115.jpg/600x600bb.jpg', 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts112/v4/61/7b/bd/617bbd1b-f044-32de-ea79-49ef786c4775/mza_16513957672551773115.jpg/600x600bb.jpg', 'مقدم', 'المسيرة المهنية', 'بودكاست حقيقي: Real English Conversations Podcast | English Fluency For Newcomers And International Professionals', 'أونلاين', v_cat, true, 50000)
  RETURNING id INTO v_host_id;

  INSERT INTO podcasts (title, description, host_id, category_id, type, cover_url, audience_level, plays_count, rating_avg)
  VALUES ('Real English Conversations Podcast | English Fluency For Newcomers And International Professionals', '🚀 The Real English Conversations Podcast Confident English for Immigrants & International Professionals You already have the skills, education, and experience. Now you need the English confidence to match. If you''ve ever struggled to speak up in meetings, explain your ideas clearly, network with confidence, or communicate naturally with native speakers, this podcast is for you. The Real English Conversations Podcast helps immigrants and international professionals build the communication skills they need to succeed in English-speaking countries. Hosted by Curtis Davies, ESL teacher, confidenc', v_host_id, v_cat, 'professional', 'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts112/v4/61/7b/bd/617bbd1b-f044-32de-ea79-49ef786c4775/mza_16513957672551773115.jpg/600x600bb.jpg', 'beginner', 100000, 4.7)
  RETURNING id INTO v_pod_id;

  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️New Episode: How to Overcome Speaking Anxiety, Stop Freezing &amp; Build Confidence in English with Christina D. George | Real English Conversations Podcast for Global Professionals', 'Have you ever known exactly what you wanted to say in English, but when the moment came, your mind went blank, and the words just wouldn''t come out? In this week''s episode of the Real English Conversations Podcast, Curtis Davies is joined by Christina D. George, an adult ESL instructor, professional speaker, storyteller, and author of the forthcoming book From the Depths . We explore why even capable English speakers can freeze under pressure, how fear of making mistakes affects communication, and what you can do to become more confident speaking English in everyday and professional situations', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_copy_of_edit_-_christina__curtis_audio_editing.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 2672, '2026-11-18 11:30:00'::timestamptz, 5000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️How To Speak English Like A Champion With Frederick Martinez | Real English Conversations Podcast For Global Professionals', 'What if the biggest thing holding you back isn''t a lack of ability, but the way you think about yourself? In this week''s episode of the Real English Conversations Podcast, Curtis Davies is joined by Frederick Martinez, an aerospace engineer, international award-winning author, former NCAA Division I athlete, Team USA Masters weightlifting competitor, and peak mental performance strategist. Frederick shares how he overcame learning challenges, academic setbacks, and personal obstacles to build a successful engineering career and compete at an elite athletic level. His journey offers an importan', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_copy_of_magic_episode_01_audio_editing_3.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 3363, '2026-11-11 11:30:00'::timestamptz, 6000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️The NEW English Phrasal Verb Podcast | Real English Conversations Podcast For Global Professionals', 'In this week''s episode of the Real English Conversations Podcast , host Curtis Davies reveals a powerful secret that even many loyal listeners don''t know: there''s another Real English Conversations podcast, what we call A Sister Podcast , that''s been quietly helping learners around the world for over 10 years : 👉 The English Phrasal Verb Podcast. If you''ve been studying English for years but still struggle to sound natural, this is the episode you''ve been waiting for. Curtis breaks down why most professionals can read and write English perfectly but freeze under pressure when speaking, and ho', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_copy_of_magic_episode_01_audio_editing_2Phrasal.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 415, '2026-10-29 03:43:00'::timestamptz, 7000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️How to Build Real English Confidence, Overcome Limiting Beliefs &amp; Find Your Purpose in 90 Days with Chonsten Jennings | Real English Conversations Podcast For Global Professionals', 'What would your life look like 90 days from now if you finally took a risk on yourself? What if the biggest thing standing between you and the career, confidence, or life you want isn''t a lack of ability—but the beliefs you''ve developed about what you can and cannot do? In this episode of the Real English Conversations Podcast , Curtis Davies sits down with Chonsten Jennings , speaker, entrepreneur, and co-founder of The Purpose Engine, for a powerful conversation about confidence, personal growth, purpose, and overcoming the mental barriers that hold us back. After years of coaching basketbal', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_magic_episode_01_audio_editing_chonsten.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 2798, '2026-10-21 10:30:00'::timestamptz, 8000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️How To Never Forget The English Words When You Need Them | Real English Conversations Podcast For Global Professionals', '🎙️ Learn English with Teacher Curtis & Real English Conversations If you''re serious about becoming more fluent, confident, and natural in English, I can help you take the next step. ⭐ Book a Trial English Lesson Start with a personalized lesson focused on your specific English goals: https://realenglishconversations.com/memberships/member-plans/fluency-programs/trial-lesson/ 🚀 90-Day Next Level English Challenge — 50% OFF If you''re ready for serious one-on-one support, you can join my 90-Day Next Level English Challenge . Use coupon code: 90DAY50 for 50% OFF . https://realenglishconversation', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_edit_02_-_53_building_vocabulary_podcast_version_audio_editing.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 1384, '2026-10-14 10:30:00'::timestamptz, 9000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️How to Ask Better Questions &amp; Communicate with Confidence at Work with Andres Lares | Real English Conversations Podcast For Global Professionals', 'What if becoming a better communicator isn''t about talking more? What if it''s about asking better questions, listening more carefully, and creating an environment where people actually want to share? In this episode of the Real English Conversations Podcast , Curtis Davies sits down with Andres Lares , CEO and Managing Partner of Shapiro Negotiations Institute, to explore the communication skills that can change the outcome of a negotiation, job interview, business meeting, presentation, or difficult workplace conversation. Andrés brings a unique perspective to this conversation because Englis', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_copy_of_magic_episode_01_audio_editing_1.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 2059, '2026-10-07 10:30:00'::timestamptz, 10000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️From English Learner to English Teacher: How Diego Used Real English Conversations to Become Fluent, Confident &amp; Professional in English | Real English Conversations Podcast for Global Professionals', 'What if the English you''ve been listening to could actually become the English you speak? What if you stopped treating podcasts as something you simply listen to … …and started using them as a complete English-learning system ? That is exactly what Diego Nieto did. Diego grew up in Cabimas, Zulia, Venezuela, and became fascinated by English as a child. Years later, when he was searching for a way to improve his listening, he discovered the Real English Conversations Podcast . At first, he couldn''t understand everything he heard. So he created his own system. He would listen to an episode witho', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_copy_of_magic_episode_01_audio_editing.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 2922, '2026-09-30 10:30:00'::timestamptz, 11000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️Business English For High-Performing Global Teams, AI &amp; the Future of Work with Marc Snegg | Real English Conversations Podcast for Global Professionals', 'What does it really take to become a trusted and valuable professional on a global team? In today''s workplace, having strong technical skills isn''t always enough. If you work remotely for an international company, especially a U.S.-based organization, your ability to communicate proactively, take ownership, solve problems, build trust, and adapt to AI can have a major impact on your professional success. In this episode of the Real English Conversations Podcast , Curtis talks with Marc Snegg , founder and CEO of Ground Game, about what it really takes to succeed as an international professiona', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_copy_of_edit_-_marc__curtis_audio_editing.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 2763, '2026-09-16 10:00:00'::timestamptz, 12000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️Learn Real English Fluency Through Travel &amp; Immersion | Real English Conversations Podcast For Global Professionals', 'Have you ever wondered what it would be like to experience another country as a local rather than as a tourist ? In this special episode from the archives, Curtis and Former co-host Amy talk about their incredible three-month experience in Colombia. They traveled to Barranquilla on Colombia''s Caribbean coast to experience Carnival, but instead of simply staying in hotels and visiting tourist attractions, they stayed with friends and their families. That allowed them to experience Colombian culture from the inside—from everyday social activities and local food to music, dancing, street parties,', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_edit_-_carnival_in_colombia___v2_1_audio_editing.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 1160, '2026-09-09 10:30:00'::timestamptz, 13000);
  INSERT INTO episodes (podcast_id, title, description, audio_url, duration_seconds, published_at, plays_count)
