  VALUES (v_pod_id, '🎙️Advanced Voice Biofeedback &amp; Business English with Deepak Chari | Real English Conversations Podcast for Global Professionals', 'In this episode of the Real English Conversations Podcast — the show that helps global professionals to speak clearly and confidently at work — host Curtis Davies talks with Deepak Chari, MS , an Engineer, Certified Biofeedback Specialist, and co-founder of the Chari Center of Health. Deepak is the creator of the Life Transformation Technology™ Program , which uses Advanced Voice Biofeedback to help people release hidden emotional blocks from stress, anxiety, past emotional experiences, and even ancestral patterns. His work helps clients feel calm, confident, empowered, and emotionally free , ', 'https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pscrb.fm/rss/p/traffic.libsyn.com/secure/f2d756de-8697-40ae-8229-f32dc253974e/riverside_curtis__deepak_podcas...___dec_29_2025_001_rec_youtube_videos_.mp3?dest-id=3695967', 2248, '2025-12-31 11:30:00'::timestamptz, 44000);
